     "body": "<p>This PR needs some work, but I need someone to review it and make sure I am not going crazy.</p>\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-1832\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-1832\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Unable to assign ACL to system space\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-1832\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n takes care of the problem for now. This is a better end to using the JCR directly.<br/>\nPR - <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-transform/pull/11\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-transform/pull/11</a></p>",
